<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">RRK66.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha eyaahandiikirwe Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA EYAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">YUDA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13:55</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Yuda, omuhuuku wa Yesu Kristo, kandi murumuna wa Yakobo, naabahandiikira imwe abaayetsirwe, abarikukundwa omuri Ruhanga Isheboona, kandi abarindiirwe Yesu Kristo; <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />embabazi n'obusingye n'okukunda byeyongyere omuriimwe.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okumanyisa ebibi ebiribaho omu biro by'aha mperu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Abarikukundwa, ku naabaire niinyezirika munonga kubahandiikira eby'okujunwa kwaitu twena, nkagyemwa kubahandiikira nimbeehanangiriza kurwanira munonga okwikiriza oku abarikwera baahairwe rimwe kikahwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:4">Gal 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba hariho abantu bamwe abashensheire omuriitwe batamanyirwe, abaarangirwe ira ku baricwerwa orubanja oru; n'abantu abatatiina Ruhanga, abahindura embabazi za Ruhanga orwekwatso ngu bashambane, bakeehakana Omutegyeki waitu omwe wenka kandi Omujuni waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:35">Kub 14:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu n'obu muraabe mwamanyiire kimwe byona, niinyenda kubaijutsya nti, Mukama owaajunire eihanga ry'Israeli okuruga omu nsi ya Misri, bwanyima akahwerekyereza abataraikiriize; <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:4">2 Pet 2:4</ref>, <ref loc="2PE 2:9">9</ref>. </char></note> kandi na baamaraika, abatararinzire bukuru bwabo, bakaruga omu mwanya gwabo ogu baabaire batuuramu, akibarindiire omu mwirima omu njegyere ezitarugwamu, okuhitsya aha kiro kikuru eky'orubanja; <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:4-25">Kut 19:4-25</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:6">2 Pet 2:6</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'aba Sodoma na Gomora n'ab'omu ndembo ezaabaire zihereraine nazo, abaayehaireyo omu bushambani n'okukoranaho eby'enshoni ebitari by'obuhangwa, bakaheebwa ekifubiro ky'omuriro ogutaraara, baaba eky'okureeberaho.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 2:10">2 Pet 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omu muringo ogwo abashaija abo bashiisha emibiri yaabo omu birooto, bagaya obutegyeki, kandi bajuma ab'ekitiinisa. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zek 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Mikaeli maraika omukuru, ku yaarwaniise Sitaane, naahakana nawe nibafa omubiri gwa Musa, tareehangire kumucwera rubanja naamujuma, kureka akagira ati: Mukama akuhane. <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Kwonka abashaija abo bajuma ebi batarikumanya; kandi ebi barikumanya, babimanyisibwa obuntu bwabo nk'enyamaishwa ezitaine bwengye, nibyo bakoresa okweshiisha. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Kut 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:15">2 Pet 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">Kub 31:16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:22">16:22</ref>. </char></note> Baryakareeba! Ahakuba batoora omuhanda gwa Kaini, boohokyera omu buhabe bwa Balamu ahabw'okutunga enshaagi, kandi bacwekyererera omu bugomi bwa Koora. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Abo, ku baba nibarya naimwe, ni nk'amabara agarikushiisha amagyenyi gaanyu ag'okukundana; n'abariisa b'entaama abariisa enda zaabo batarikutiina; n'ebicu ebitarimu njura ebitwarwa omuyaga; n'ebiti ebitariho byana omu bunaku bw'ekyanda ebifiire kabiri, ebirimbwirwe n'emizi; <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:21">Isa 57:21</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:17">2 Pet 2:17</ref>. </char></note> ni nk'ebingonzi by'enyanja eby'amaani, babira eifuro ry'enshoni zaabo; kandi ni nk'enyonyoozi ezitahamiire hamwe, abarindiirwe omwirima ndindindi ebiro byona.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:21">Kut 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 33:2">Bir 33:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abo nibo Enoka, owa mushanju okuruga ahari Adamu, yaaragwireho ati: Reeba, Mukama akaija n'abarikwera be obukumi n'obukumi, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />okucwera boona orubanja, n'okurusingisa boona abatatiina Ruhanga ahabw'eby'okutamutiina ebi baakozire bakamucumuraho, kandi n'ebigambo ebigumire byona ebi abasiisi abatatiina Ruhanga baamugambireho nibamurwanisa. <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:18">2 Pet 2:18</ref>. </char></note> Abo n'abeetomboita, abatuura nibatonzya, abakurata okwetenga kwabo okubi, abeehimbisa n'ebigambo ebirengyesereize, kandi abaha abantu ekitiinisa nibabendamu enshaagi. <verse eid="JUD 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Kwonka imwe, abarikukundwa, mwijukye ebigambo ebyagambirwe ira entumwa za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:1">1 Tim 4:1</ref>. </char></note> oku zaabagambiire, nizigira ziti: Omu biro by'aha mperu haryabaho abashekyerezi, abarikukurata okwetenga kwabo okw'okutatiina Ruhanga. <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Abo nibo bareeta okwetaanisamu, abantu-buntu abataine Mwoyo. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:7">Kol 2:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka imwe, abarikukundwa, mweyombekye aha musingi gw'okwikiriza kwanyu okurikwera munonga; mushabe omu Mwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Mwerindire omu kukunda kwa Ruhanga; mutegyereze okusaasira kwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, okuribahitsya omu magara agatahwaho. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Kandi abamwe abarikubanganisa mubaikiririse; <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zek 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:19">Yak 5:19</ref>. </char></note> abandi mubakize nimubashahura omu muriro; n'abandi mubasaasire nimutiina, nangwa mwangye n'ekijwaro ekiine amabara agateirweho omubiri.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:23">1 Tes 5:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo orikubaasa kubarinda kutagwa kandi n'okubamurika omu maisho g'ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga nimushemererwa munonga mutaine kamogo, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Ruhanga ogwo omwe wenka, Omujuni waitu owaatujunire ahabwa Yesu Kristo Mukama waitu, aheebwe ekitiinisa eky'obukama bwe n'obutegyeki n'obushoboorozi, ebi yaabaire aine ira ryona, hati n'ebiro byona. Amiina.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>